!! Edges

<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/wiki-layer-ontology`>> the record: the alpha transition, the crossing grain, the open closure, the pack refinements, what the build owes

<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/system-pattern-integrities#/threshold-pattern-integrities`>>
<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/causal-islands`>>
